[{:db/id "q-70935/selection/8761d4e1e5e61c94b28040a0043cf4f134541940604057824d5e19eb5a501ec3" :answer/id #uuid "077f0fe2-b40d-51af-9812-7476a424b009" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(-3,-3)$ and radius is $\\sqrt{5}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70935/selection/765ddaa4522f668233974714f41c4a49f0c715c450495b10ea081858a6d427ba" :answer/id #uuid "2d3c565c-c49c-55d4-b10b-72ea32d31f15" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(3,3)$ and radius is $5$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70935/selection/fbaa5c6b3262d480e206b70a73ab2effca2146769310465aac8403d7448fbc2b" :answer/id #uuid "71808190-d359-5251-aca3-450cacd2e046" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(-3,3)$ and radius is $5$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70935/selection/c42355c923bae7dbceffb307f46d481b8c7d5f46834e2d923bcf81f3fe78236c" :answer/id #uuid "1b70ece9-a54d-5b0e-9d81-6c970003dedb" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(3,3)$ and radius is $\\sqrt{5}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70935/selection/e94d172e26db0cad571c1e6251331946885e9474792d1338150316d6d232ea50" :answer/id #uuid "6e5cd240-1bdb-5928-a625-8aa1d041f0ab" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(-3,-3)$ and radius is $5$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70935/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c124b45c-0e7b-5924-9007-da3bcb6e0abd" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-70935/selection/8761d4e1e5e61c94b28040a0043cf4f134541940604057824d5e19eb5a501ec3" :answer-field/choices ["q-70935/selection/8761d4e1e5e61c94b28040a0043cf4f134541940604057824d5e19eb5a501ec3" "q-70935/selection/765ddaa4522f668233974714f41c4a49f0c715c450495b10ea081858a6d427ba" "q-70935/selection/fbaa5c6b3262d480e206b70a73ab2effca2146769310465aac8403d7448fbc2b" "q-70935/selection/c42355c923bae7dbceffb307f46d481b8c7d5f46834e2d923bcf81f3fe78236c" "q-70935/selection/e94d172e26db0cad571c1e6251331946885e9474792d1338150316d6d232ea50"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-70935" :question/id #uuid "905d335a-323b-5d3e-b990-85a375e28da3" :question/math-academy-id "q-70935" :question/problem "What is the center and radius of the circle with equation $(x+3)^{2}+(y+3)^{2}=5?$" :question/worked-solution "The general equation of a circle with radius $r$ centered at the point $(a,b)$ is \n\n$$\n(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2}={r}^{2}.\n$$\n\nLet's compare the general equation to our equation side-by-side as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2} & ={r}^{2} \\\\ (x+3)^{2}+(y+3)^{2} & =5 \\\\ (x-(-3))^{2}+(y-(-3))^{2} & =(\\sqrt{5})^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe see that $a=-3,$ $b=-3,$ and $r=\\sqrt{5}.$ \n\nTherefore, the circle is centered at $(-3,-3)$ and its radius is $\\sqrt{5}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-70935/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "89462485-2e28-5727-82c7-7afd0cac6d77"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-70935"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-70987/selection/7b19fe9483c0bf314056e1cee0d1e631ad475cd73e47116a5e8f0ba7319c69a5" :answer/id #uuid "c1cac5a7-9ae6-59b4-b6ca-4b0c3714a332" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x-3)^{2}+(y-3)^{2}=16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70987/selection/2f7a8cf1ac37ef742b62f2acfe69332660b940a3bebd45801a1677cac7d7089a" :answer/id #uuid "78e9081e-db8a-55e5-8820-0a5e81399707" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x-3)^{2}+(y-3)^{2}=4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70987/selection/c750a00506ab3d0be58dbb0775c5e8acdc2d8e36c516d85f42d16c88be911d0a" :answer/id #uuid "1a838c54-b3c5-5c40-9683-f92bd7fe8ce7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x+3)^{2}+(y+3)^{2}=16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70987/selection/869643ceb2338540134e0ed2e5a4ebc233f38143c8fa9c7dbae00314fea174ec" :answer/id #uuid "d90d91fb-3708-5d22-a0ab-2ad22de9e7b2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x+3)^{2}-(y+3)^{2}=4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70987/selection/05d7aae0758b1e2e55194a9ec44c76536bb4df6bb83ee8a365034940c71febdb" :answer/id #uuid "4c6b5918-df87-5e8e-aaae-c22b4e7a1fce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x+3)^{2}+(y+3)^{2}=4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70987/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "82e6df64-4fae-5569-8df0-d3b7494b52b6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-70987/selection/7b19fe9483c0bf314056e1cee0d1e631ad475cd73e47116a5e8f0ba7319c69a5" :answer-field/choices ["q-70987/selection/7b19fe9483c0bf314056e1cee0d1e631ad475cd73e47116a5e8f0ba7319c69a5" "q-70987/selection/2f7a8cf1ac37ef742b62f2acfe69332660b940a3bebd45801a1677cac7d7089a" "q-70987/selection/c750a00506ab3d0be58dbb0775c5e8acdc2d8e36c516d85f42d16c88be911d0a" "q-70987/selection/869643ceb2338540134e0ed2e5a4ebc233f38143c8fa9c7dbae00314fea174ec" "q-70987/selection/05d7aae0758b1e2e55194a9ec44c76536bb4df6bb83ee8a365034940c71febdb"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-70987" :question/id #uuid "7cc5b5a5-0142-5c39-be39-9d3cacb3c616" :question/math-academy-id "q-70987" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974570/assets/b6a4e9a8f4a1c6dcaaad453b843896f3fc56ae22a37d481dcb4cfe54cc53361d.png)\n\nThe line segment $\\overset{―}{XY}$ is a diameter of a circle. Given that $X$ and $Y$ have coordinates $(7,3)$ and $(-1,3)$, respectively, what is the equation of the circle?" :question/worked-solution "The general equation of a circle with radius $r$ centered at the point $(a,b)$ is  \n\n$$\n(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2}={r}^{2}.\n$$\n\nUsing the distance formula to compute the distance between the points $X(7,3)$ and $Y(-1,3),$ we find that the length of the diameter is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}XY & =\\sqrt{{(7-(-1))}^{2}+{(3-3)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{8}^{2}+{0}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{64} \\\\  & =8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo the radius of the circle is \n\n$$\nr=\\frac{8}{2}=4.\n$$\n\nSince the center of a circle is the midpoint of the diameter, to find the center we use the midpoint formula as follows:\n\n$$\n(\\frac{{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}}{2},\\frac{{y}_{1}+{y}_{2}}{2})=(\\frac{7+(-1)}{2},\\frac{3+3}{2})=(3,3)\n$$\n\nSo our circle has radius $r=4$ and center $(a,b)=(3,3),$ and therefore it is represented by the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2} & ={r}^{2} \\\\ (x-3)^{2}+(y-3)^{2} & ={4}^{2} \\\\ (x-3)^{2}+(y-3)^{2} & =16\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-70987/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "47863922-b0d5-5a0b-8a01-ffefe3b3c929"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-70987"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-72619/selection/e816d6b98771c6c220ef2b6c2df66c8cd72c44697ab043866bc1f1c7511febf2" :answer/id #uuid "6ed5618f-9eee-58fa-a504-a8be43554630" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x+1)^{2}+(y+3)^{2}=20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72619/selection/9608468c865a1688375bdaf7361c40334bcff2469584070773eb36f6d7939cfd" :answer/id #uuid "bff52f7b-509c-55f3-a616-d19c98b1c81b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x+1)^{2}+(y+3)^{2}=2\\sqrt{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72619/selection/89b2a16740d33c2fd04a0d257c973d49ff514496f9ea68ace72ef576402c5285" :answer/id #uuid "198f1d79-2b13-51b3-8aa6-bdfc9c72d184" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x-1)^{2}+(y-3)^{2}=20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72619/selection/092c0e3f5f6817b1effc32c4adc424544e93e088e07e8f34ea00f58624dee9c2" :answer/id #uuid "025dacac-72b0-5fb3-bd9c-38539d0b355e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x+1)^{2}+(y-3)^{2}=20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72619/selection/b2fe518e4743be10b5210a4c4766249aaa35c4cd319f2b05780431e9a5788faf" :answer/id #uuid "cbd780b0-b6fb-5eba-9be5-53b489210677" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x-1)^{2}+(y-3)^{2}=2\\sqrt{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72619/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "6d7804ea-2943-5975-8ab9-5d3e79f5f2eb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-72619/selection/e816d6b98771c6c220ef2b6c2df66c8cd72c44697ab043866bc1f1c7511febf2" :answer-field/choices ["q-72619/selection/e816d6b98771c6c220ef2b6c2df66c8cd72c44697ab043866bc1f1c7511febf2" "q-72619/selection/9608468c865a1688375bdaf7361c40334bcff2469584070773eb36f6d7939cfd" "q-72619/selection/89b2a16740d33c2fd04a0d257c973d49ff514496f9ea68ace72ef576402c5285" "q-72619/selection/092c0e3f5f6817b1effc32c4adc424544e93e088e07e8f34ea00f58624dee9c2" "q-72619/selection/b2fe518e4743be10b5210a4c4766249aaa35c4cd319f2b05780431e9a5788faf"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-72619" :question/id #uuid "2d9605a3-33b5-5dbc-a2c1-b1fc1ffe1e35" :question/math-academy-id "q-72619" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974570/assets/2ff035f38f5892f61d1eb037c7e39c59c8ec5104babac45224c4902152a0cfaa.png)\n\nThe circle above is centered at $C(-1,-3)$ and the point $X(1,1)$ lies on the circumference. Find the equation of the circle." :question/worked-solution "The general equation of a circle with radius $r$ centered at the point $(a,b)$ is\n\n$$\n(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2}={r}^{2}.\n$$\n\nThe length of the radius is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CX & =\\sqrt{{(1-(-1))}^{2}+{(1-(-3))}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+{4}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{20}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, our circle is generated by the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2} & ={r}^{2} \\\\ (x-(-1))^{2}+(y-(-3))^{2} & =(\\sqrt{20})^{2} \\\\ (x+1)^{2}+(y+3)^{2} & =20\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-72619/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id